# This directory is a byte-exact forensic archive. Git must store every file
# exactly as captured.
#
# The machine's global config is `core.autocrlf = input`, which rewrites CRLF to
# LF on commit. Applied here that would silently corrupt the archive: the
# `sha256` values in manifest.json are hashes of the RAW bytes, and a normalised
# checkout would no longer match them, destroying the ability to prove what each
# store actually contained.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion for everything below this path.
# Do not remove it, and do not "fix" the line endings of anything in here.
* -text
